version: 0.5.1
abstract: >-
  A command-line check for work done by coding agents: an outcome counts as delivered only when its proof passes,
  fails with the change taken out, and passes again. With the measurements behind each check.
keywords:
  - coding agents
  - software testing
  - mutation testing
  - verification
